  ║  ECommerceService.wsdl                                          ║
  ║  Version     : 3.0                                              ║
  ║  Description : Full-featured SOAP 1.1 / 1.2 service definition  ║
  ║                for an e-commerce platform covering:             ║
  ║                  • Customer Management                          ║
  ║                  • Product Catalog                              ║
  ║                  • Order Management                             ║
  ║                  • Inventory & Warehouse                        ║
  ║                  • Promotions & Coupons                         ║
  ║  XSD imports : common-types.xsd                                 ║
